@kb1slnlabs/dsh-ponytail README · DSH Desktop — easiest：If you want a different default intensity, select `ultra` in the Ponytail settings;
the package default is `full`. The exact location of those settings may vary by DSH
version. If another Ponytail adapter is already installed, remove it first — see
[Coming from another adapter](#coming-from-another-adapter).

Desktop's UI installs into its own profile, so the terminal commands below are
alternatives, not extra steps.

@kb1slnlabs/dsh-ponytail README · Desktop app：Restart DSH, then open **Settings → Plugins → Ponytail**. Choose a default mode (for
example, `ultra`) and save. The package default is `full`. For details on profile
configuration and migration, see the [adapter reference](docs/REFERENCE.md).

@kb1slnlabs/dsh-ponytail README · Coming from another adapter：If `@mengyuly/dsh-ponytail` is installed, remove that plugin first, then follow the
[migration section of the reference](docs/REFERENCE.md#migration-from-mengyulydsh-ponytail--remove-that-plugin-first-then-replace-its-row)
to replace its override row and keep your settings.
